From: Nikhil Gurram <nikhgurr@qti.qualcomm.com>
Subject: [PATCH] pwhm: restore MLO links on retained anchors after re-enable

Keep the verified kernel MLD anchor when a radio rejoins surviving links.
Queue per-BSS additions instead of removing the retained MLD through a
control socket now serving another band. Preserve normal migration and
cold-start handling.

Reconcile stale hostapdRemoved state after a complete shutdown/start while
retaining the obligation to restore missing sibling links. This fixes
partial re-enable after a full disable/enable cycle without losing links
or moving them to an incorrect anchor.

Signed-off-by: Nikhil Gurram <nikhgurr@qti.qualcomm.com>

